.TH NETBOX-DNS-ZONE-PUBLISHER 1 "September 2026" "0.1.0"
.SH NAME
netbox-dns-zone-publisher \- collect and publish NetBox DNS snapshots
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B netbox-dns-zone-publisher
.BI --config " FILE"
.B collect|publish
.SH DESCRIPTION
Collects DNS records from NetBox DNS, checks and optionally signs zone files,
and publishes verified snapshots to local directories or remote hosts over SSH.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B collect
Read NetBox DNS, normalize and validate records, optionally sign zones.
.TP
.B publish
Deploy the selected snapshot. This does not contact NetBox or sign zones.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --config " FILE"
Read configuration from the specified TOML file. Required for both commands.
.TP
.B --help
Show command usage.
.TP
.B --version
Show program version.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/netbox-dns-zone-publisher/publisher.toml
Configuration for netbox-dns-zone-publisher.
.TP
.I /var/lib/netbox-dns-zone-publisher
Default state directory used by the example configuration.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero on success; nonzero on failure.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B RUST_LOG
Configure log filtering (default: info).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR named-checkzone (1),
.BR dnssec-signzone (1),
.BR ssh (1)
.PP
See /usr/share/doc/netbox-dns-zone-publisher/README.Debian for setup instructions.
